Dear Michael, Priyanka, and Sarah,

&nbsp;

I refer to your below email of 17 October 2025 addressed to the Board which you state is intended to be a protected disclosure.

&nbsp;

The Firm takes any professional and regulatory concerns raised by anyone at the Firm very seriously and so I firstly want to thank you for raising your concerns with the
 Board.

&nbsp;

As COLP, I will be investigating your concerns in accordance with our Whistleblowing Policy.&nbsp;I expect to&nbsp;provide you with a response in relation to the content of your below
 email once this investigation has been completed – which I will do by the end of this week.&nbsp;

