On the Post-July point:
We are 100% on the same page for the scenario if Cs win the PDD trial.
On scenario B (Cs lose PDD), I think the difference come from these two parts of your list below:

Quantum trial will not happen&nbsp;– when we were discussing this earlier in the year pre-PTR, I recall there was hesitation in the group
 about whether it would be as simple as this (or at least whether it was something we were happy to express this in these absolute terms). That’s where my concerns about the case for ‘full’ cover originate from. If we are now able (and happy) to say that an
 adverse outcome in the PDD trial would mean in practice that the T3 trial was immediately vacated that’s fine, but my understanding from previous chats was that it might not be as simple as this, and/or there could be outcomes which were effectively losses
