 and why, please see our&nbsp;Privacy Policy.From: Helena Yearwood &lt;hyearwood@pogustgoodhead.com&gt; Sent: 10 October 2025 09:53To: Neil Pigott &lt;Neil.Pigott@pallasllp.com&gt;; Tom Crow &lt;tcrow@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Carolina Koschdoski de Souza &lt;csouza@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc: Anna Varga &lt;avarga@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Jessica Fechner &lt;jfechner@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Subject: RE: Defendants’ Submissions and Draft Order – Costs of CMH2&nbsp;Hi Neil,&nbsp;I am incorporating some of your suggested edits and will send over shortly.&nbsp;Many thanks Helena &nbsp;​​​​Helena&nbsp;YearwoodRisk&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Compliance&nbsp;DirectorFrom: Neil Pigott &lt;Neil.Pigott@pallasllp.com&gt; Sent: 10 October 2025 09:14To: Tom Crow &lt;tcrow@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Carolina Koschdoski de Souza &lt;csouza@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc: Helena Yearwood &lt;hyearwood@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Anna Varga &lt;avarga@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Jessica Fechner &lt;jfechner@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Subject: RE: Defendants’ Submissions and Draft Order – Costs of CMH2&nbsp;CAUTION: This email originated from outside of the organization. Do not click links or open attachments unless you recognize the sender and know the content is safe.&nbsp;Tom,&nbsp;Have you included our suggested edits sent yesterday or are those going to be added please?&nbsp;I will review in the meantime but please let me know on the above.&nbsp;Many thanks,&nbsp;Neil&nbsp;Neil&nbsp;PigottPartnerT:&nbsp;+44&nbsp;20&nbsp;4574&nbsp;1005|M:&nbsp;+44&nbsp;75&nbsp;5741&nbsp;2828E:&nbsp;&nbsp;neil.pigott@pallasllp.com110&nbsp;Bishopsgate,&nbsp;London,&nbsp;EC2N&nbsp;4AYpallasllp.com&nbsp;|&nbsp;LinkedInPallas Partners LLP is a limited liability partnership registered in England with registered number OC437491, and is authorised and regulated by the Solicitors Regulation Authority of England and Wales (“SRA”) with SRA number 826251. A list of names of the members is available for inspection at our registered address at&nbsp