Dear Erika and Gregory,&nbsp;A very warm welcome to the NOx team - it is great to have you both!!&nbsp;&nbsp;By&nbsp;way&nbsp;of&nbsp;introduction, I am a paralegal at Pogust Goodhead, currently working on the NOx Emissions litigation, in the Mercedes, JLR and Renault/Nissan proceedings. We will shortly be requesting your addition to the Confidentiality ring (CRO) across all cases (The Defendants will have five working days to accept/refuse your addition as per paragraph 4.1.2&nbsp;of&nbsp;the sealed orders attached). &nbsp;&nbsp;I have attached to the zip folder all undertakings to be signed and the relevant sealed order. For completeness, the CROs relate to (i) Mercedes (February and July Orders) (ii) Nissan (iii) Renault (iv) PCD (v) Ford and (vi) Pan-Lead.&nbsp;We would be grateful if you could add to the undertakings the following:&nbsp;Your name and qualification/position (e.g., Barrister, Solicitor, Partner, etc.), to the second paragraph on page one.Add your signature, name and date to the signature block on the second page. An&nbsp;e-signature&nbsp;is fine.&nbsp;&nbsp;Please let us know if you have any questions about the above; we will be happy to answer.&nbsp;&nbsp;Many thanks,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;"}

