Hi all,&nbsp;Clyde’s have reviewed the draft letter and have suggested a couple of refinements in the attached. &nbsp;They have also suggested that we avoid commenting on TGs ethical responsibilities and instead address the matter through the inclusion of the following:&nbsp;As you may be aware, Thomas Goodhead is no longer with the firm. In light of these circumstances, we do not consider it appropriate to comment on his individual status.&nbsp;Kind regards,Helena &nbsp;&nbsp;​​​​Helena&nbsp;YearwoodRisk&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Compliance&nbsp;DirectorFrom: Anna Varga &lt;avarga@pogustgoodhead.com&gt; Sent: 30 October 2025 16:03To: Craig Shuttleworth &lt;craig@kastlesolicitors.com&gt;; Matthew Getz &lt;Matthew.Getz@pallasllp.com&gt;; Craig Shuttleworth &lt;cshuttleworth@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Xenia Kalognomas &lt;Xenia.Kalognomas@pallasllp.com&gt;; Holly Hampton &lt;hhampton@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Federica Lombardi &lt;flombardi@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc: Helena Yearwood &lt;hyearwood@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Alicia Alinia &lt;aalinia@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Raminder Grewal &lt;rgrewal@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Plate Litigation &lt;plate_litigation@pallasllp.com&gt;Subject: Re: Report&nbsp;Hi all&nbsp;Just catching up - was in court again today. Helena will shortly share the letter with some edits proposed by Fergal from Clydes. It will also address the position on Tom. Let's consider once that lands.&nbsp;Matt - thanks for your email separately. I'm taking the liberty to relay Giles W KC advice re consultant point:&nbsp;There is no inherent regulatory bar on a solicitor at another firm being engaged to work as a consultant on a particular matter.&nbsp; From a conduct of litigation perspective, I don’t see any problem with this.&nbsp;There are of course a raft of issues that any such consultancy arrangement would need to address, e.g. how to deal with conflicts of interest, lines of supervision/responsibility, client consent, the terms of the consultancy engagement, and no doubt various other issues.&nbsp; There will always be questions that can be asked about these arrangements, but (a) I’m not sure that there would be any real justification for Slaughters probing into them, and (b) there is no reason why these points can’t be satisfactorily dealt with by a suitable consultancy agreement, such that it can work without any giving rise to any regulatory problems.&nbsp;​​​​Anna&nbsp;VargaPartner+44&nbsp;(0)&nbsp;7890&nbsp;043&nbsp;699From: Craig Shuttleworth &lt;craig@kastlesolicitors.com&gt;Sent: Thursday, October 30, 2025 3:49 PMTo: Matthew Getz &lt;Matthew.Getz@pallasllp.com&gt;; Craig Shuttleworth &lt;cshuttleworth@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Anna Varga &lt;avarga@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Xenia Kalognomas &lt;Xenia.Kalognomas@pallasllp.com&gt;; Holly Hampton &lt;hhampton@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Federica Lombardi &lt;flombardi@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc: Helena Yearwood &lt;hyearwood@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Alicia Alinia &lt;aalinia@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Raminder Grewal &lt;rgrewal@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Plate Litigation &lt;plate_litigation@pallasllp.com&gt;Subject: RE: Report &nbsp;CAUTION: This email originated from outside of the organization. Do not click links or open attachments unless you recognize the sender and know the content is safe.&nbsp;Can we fix a call early next week ?&nbsp;Craig Shuttleworth07770 847435&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;From: Craig Shuttleworth Sent: 30 October 2025 14:37To: 'Matthew Getz' &lt;Matthew.Getz@pallasllp.com&gt;; Craig Shuttleworth &lt;cshuttleworth@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Anna Varga &lt;avarga@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Xenia Kalognomas &lt;Xenia.Kalognomas@pallasllp.com&gt;; Holly Hampton &lt;hhampton@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Federica Lombardi &lt;flombardi@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc: Helena Yearwood &lt;hyearwood@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Alicia Alinia &lt;aalinia@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Raminder Grewal &lt;rgrewal@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Plate Litigation &lt;plate_litigation@pallasllp.com&gt;Subject: RE: Report&nbsp;So where did we get to on this ?&nbsp;Also can I have the authority that says it is ok for me to conduct as a consultant ?&nbsp;Craig Shuttleworth07770 847435&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;From: Matthew Getz &lt;Matthew.Getz@pallasllp.com&gt; Sent: 29 October 2025 11:44To: Craig Shuttleworth &lt;cshuttleworth@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Anna Varga &lt;avarga@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Xenia Kalognomas &lt;Xenia.Kalognomas@pallasllp.com&gt;; Holly Hampton &lt;hhampton@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Federica Lombardi &lt;flombardi@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc: Helena Yearwood &lt;hyearwood@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Alicia Alinia &lt;aalinia@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Raminder Grewal &lt;rgrewal@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Plate Litigation &lt;plate_litigation@pallasllp.com&gt;; Craig Shuttleworth &lt;craig@kastlesolicitors.com&gt;Subject: RE: Report&nbsp;Craig, when you refer to “the TG one”, is there another letter that has come in?&nbsp;ThanksMatt&nbsp;Matthew&nbsp;Getz​​​​PartnerT:&nbsp;+44&nbsp;20&nbsp;4574&nbsp;1006|M:&nbsp;+44&nbsp;79&nbsp;8538&nbsp;1095E:&nbsp;&nbsp;matthew.getz@pallasllp.com110&nbsp;Bishopsgate,&nbsp;London,&nbsp;EC2N&nbsp;4AYpallasllp.com&nbsp;|&nbsp;LinkedInFrom: Craig Shuttleworth &lt;cshuttleworth@pogustgoodhead.com&gt; Sent: 29 October 2025 11:37To: Anna Varga &lt;avarga@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Matthew Getz &lt;Matthew.Getz@pallasllp.com&gt;; Xenia Kalognomas &lt;Xenia.Kalognomas@pallasllp.com&gt;; Holly Hampton &lt;hhampton@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Federica Lombardi &lt;flombardi@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc: Helena Yearwood &lt;hyearwood@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Alicia Alinia &lt;aalinia@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Raminder Grewal &lt;rgrewal@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Plate Litigation &lt;plate_litigation@pallasllp.com&gt;; Craig Shuttleworth &lt;craig@kastlesolicitors.com&gt;Subject: RE: Report&nbsp;Good catch from Holly &amp; Fede. We can’t send this as we make the situation intolerable when replying to the TG one and probably harm ourselves..&nbsp;Tom said this&nbsp;That is also 